<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '24px 64px 0' }}>
    {/* A 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 96, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423' }}>
            步骤 8–10：<span style={{ color: '#FA4F24' }}>指标 → 举措 → 举措设计</span>
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#8A8F99', marginTop: 8 }}>
            这三步是一条链：愿景定了价值，指标量价值，举措改价值——中间断一环，架构就落不了地
        </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E8E8E8' }} />

    {/* B 区 */}
    <Box style={{ paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 12, height: 479, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9 }}>

        {/* 上：三步链 */}
        <Box style={{ height: 168, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch' }}>
            {[
                { n: '08', t: '定义数字化转型指标体系', c: '#C43A17', opt: true,
                  a: '设计一套指标体系，衡量转型工作是否对准价值达成、是否达到预设指标值',
                  b: '在传统指标基础上，增加与数字化转型直接相关的数字化指标',
                  o: '指标体系与预设值' },
                { n: '09', t: '识别数字化转型举措', c: '#C43A17', opt: false,
                  a: '基于架构蓝图，识别支撑愿景实现的关键成功要素',
                  b: '形成举措，对举措进行描述和定义，明确举措的目标',
                  o: '举措清单与举措目标' },
                { n: '10', t: '举措设计', c: '#C43A17', opt: true,
                  a: '为更好落实举措，打开每个举措，设计举措的架构方案',
                  b: '同时将举措细化到具体的变革点',
                  o: '举措架构方案与变革点' },
            ].map((x, i) => (
                <Box key={x.n} style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch' }}>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F7F8', borderRadius: 4, padding: '13px 15px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 7 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: x.c }}>{x.n}</Text>
                            {x.opt && (
                                <Box style={{ height: 15, borderRadius: 2, border: '1px solid #8A8F99', padding: '0 5px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 9.5, color: '#8A8F99' }}>可选</Text>
                                </Box>
                            )}
                        </Box>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423', marginTop: 8, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>{x.t}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#3A4050', lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 8, flex: 1 }}>{x.a}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#5A6070', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>{x.b}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 10.5, color: x.c, marginTop: 7 }}>产出：{x.o}</Text>
                    </Box>
                    {i < 2 && (
                        <Box style={{ width: 26, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FBA15C' }}>→</Text>
                        </Box>
                    )}
                </Box>
            ))}
        </Box>

        {/* 中：链条图与断裂点 */}
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#0F1423', borderRadius: 4, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FBA15C' }}>这条链一旦断裂，后面全是空转</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8, marginTop: 12 }}>
                    {[
                        { f: '愿景', t: '要成为什么', x: '没有指标 → 无法判断做到没做到' },
                        { f: '指标', t: '值多少算成', x: '没有举措 → 指标挂在旧流程上' },
                        { f: '举措', t: '做什么能改变', x: '没有设计 → 举措停在口号层' },
                        { f: '变革点', t: '改到哪一步', x: '没有项目 → 变革点没人承接' },
                    ].map((x, i) => (
                        <Box key={x.f} style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)', borderRadius: 2, padding: '0 13px', gap: 11 }}>
                            <Box style={{ width: 54, height: 22, background: ['#FA4F24', '#E0641E', '#D2531A', '#C43A17'][i], borderRadius: 2, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                                <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>{x.f}</Text>
                            </Box>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.85)', width: 96 }}>{x.t}</Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#FBA15C', flex: 1 }}>{x.x}</Text>
                        </Box>
                    ))}
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 424, background: '#FFF3EE', borderRadius: 4, borderLeft: '4px solid #FBA15C', padding: '14px 18px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C43A17' }}>指标体系最容易做错的地方</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9, marginTop: 12 }}>
                    {[
                        { k: '全用结果指标', v: '只统计营收、成本、利润，改善动作无法归因，出问题没人认领' },
                        { k: '全用过程指标', v: '上线率、培训人数都很漂亮，客户体验一点没变——装样子' },
                        { k: '预设值没拍过', v: '指标定了但目标值是拍的，年底再改一次，体系就废了' },
                    ].map((x) => (
                        <Box key={x.k} style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423' }}>{x.k}</Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#5A6070', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 3 }}>{x.v}</Text>
                        </Box>
                    ))}
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        {/* 底部 */}
        <Box style={{ height: 36, background: '#0F1423', borderRadius: 3, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 20px', gap: 16 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FBA15C', width: 148 }}>结果 + 过程 + 体验</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#FFFFFF', flex: 1 }}>三类指标要一起上：只有结果说清原因，只有过程说清价值，只有体验说清这是不是转型</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* C 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 14, height: 14, background: '#FA4F24' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8F99' }}>硕磐机密 · 华为数字化转型之道</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8F99' }}>24 / 35</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>